{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The making of a merry &amp; macabre adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with concept art, storyboards, character sketches, design notes, and more,<i> The Art of Foolish Mortals</i>\u00a0invites you behind the scene of the hand-crafted point &amp; click adventure game. You'll discover early ideas, abandoned concepts, and in the in-progress developments that shaped the mysterious island of Devil's Rock. From a childhood of adventures to a game far beyond its initial expectations,<i> The Art of Foolish Mortals</i> shows how the ghosts of Bellemore Manor were brought to life... without the need for a Summoning Spell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a foreword by Jonathan Ackley, Co-Director of<i> The Curse of Monkey Island</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>74 pages.\u00a0English language only.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also available as part of the Foolish Mortals Deluxe Edition bundle.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095650?t=1762174314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095650/376857cb63725b91086d6de6bf7d8d7a8c8f17fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762174314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095650/9c013cfee0732bb0c74b247d30ed53952826c66c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762174314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095650/9c013cfee0732bb0c74b247d30ed53952826c66c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762174314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The making of a merry &amp; macabre adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with concept art, storyboards, chara